{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000dde1","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0af07-89f4-7ab1-8e06-e8d6537acf87"},"sequence":3403,"recorded_at":1780531400006801,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"5cf12a39-f5bf-4b30-87e7-6389df903783","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"5cf12a39-f5bf-4b30-87e7-6389df903783","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"5cf12a39-f5bf-4b30-87e7-6389df903783"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Ready for review — handed off to review.\n\nRepublish-rev3 complete: the finished 2atgj4 candidate was rebased from trunk `e4e3e88` onto `7bf90af` with no product-code change and re-verified end to end.\n\n- **Refresh:** `refresh_advanced` to branch tip `995fe54` (replayed `bf21147`/`995fe54`, both signed). The 2f5393 replay applied cleanly; the 3g12yp replay needed 5 resolutions (README, registry JSON, digest pin, both test-pin files — LOGBOOK merged cleanly, contrary to the brief's expectation). Registry merged as a verified semantic union (128 cases, 49/511 clauses at the replayed head); the resolved replay tree was built and test-green before the resolutions were submitted.\n- **Reconciliation:** 99 stale-carry paths restored to HEAD; 9 candidate paths hand-merged with per-file verification (3 Go files byte-identical to the leaf since trunk never touched them; registry 131 cases with the 3 leaf rows intact; digest re-pinned to `39087ef8…`; README keeps trunk's `-adopted` text plus the property section; LOGBOOK purely additive with one count-line accuracy fix). Status shows exactly the 13 candidate paths, uncommitted, no `.pyc`.\n- **Validation:** all 26 configured commands exit 0 (32 packages ok in test/race/cover; tracecheck 131 cases, 49/511; cataloggen `-adopted`), 11/11 ownership properties pass, and the mutant battery re-kills 8/8 narrowing plants with the harmless control surviving on the rebased tree.\n- **Evidence:** `TASK-2608